<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Ark. Power and Light bonds.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Ark. Power and Light bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp. said Thursday it had a limited amount of secondary market insurance capacity for Arkansas Power and Light first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>For more information, call 800-624-2660.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
